/* 五大软坏结局（V6精修版：Hub精简、图标≤3、收益平衡、$location对齐） */
:: MP BadEnd Velvet Doll [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to ($mpBadEndProgress or 0)>><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1)>>
<<if ($mpBadEndId or "") isnot "velvet">><<set $mpBadEndId to "velvet">><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><</if>>
峭壁天鹅绒暗层的水晶展柜亮着暖紫射灯，你的脚踝扣着细银链，单向玻璃外传来宾客碰杯声。
<<if $exposed gte 2>>礼服衬里被剪去大半，外侧窥视目光令你耳根发烫。<<elseif $arousal gte 4000>>甜腻兰花香钻入鼻腔，指尖泛起轻颤。<<else>>你借丝绒裙摆掩住腿侧，冷静打量四角固定桩与换气格栅。<</if>>
<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 100>>
	踝链锁簧已挑松，铜镜后亮起了莫奈约定的暗门微光。
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[趁黑撞开侧窗 (0:12)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll EscapeWin]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 60>>锁扣已松开大半。<<elseif ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 30>>你已摸清送餐窗与锁孔构造。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[靠送餐窗搭话 (0:18)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll Pose]]>><<pass 18>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[试探锁孔 (0:16)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll Hairpin]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[叩击铜镜镜框 (0:18)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll Curtain]]>><<pass 18>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link "静听换班钟 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<replace "#velvet-doll-patience">>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or ($mpBadEndDays or 1) gte 2>>
		<span class="green">你静坐一轮沙漏，将送餐槽边的备用铜钩拢进袖口。</span><<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">甜腻熏香越积越浓，你咬住舌尖强迫自己清醒。</span><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1) + 1>><<arousal 400>><<tiredness 2>><<garousal>><<gtiredness>>
	<</if>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	<div id="velvet-doll-patience"></div>
<</if>>

:: MP BadEnd Velvet Doll Pose [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你走到展柜右侧的送餐小窗边，将一只盛着冰镇果酒的高脚杯递到你手边。
<<if ($tiredness or 0) gte 800>>连日困在狭窄的展柜里让你小腿发酸，你扶住窗沿才稳住身形。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[敛裙退回软垫 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-pose-choices">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "接杯顺走铜钩 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-pose-choices">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 350 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 350>>
<span class="green">你迎着侍者的视线微微一笑，竟忘了锁死送餐小窗的外插销。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 45)>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">你的手指刚碰到托盘边沿，让你耳根发烫。</span>
<<stress 5>><<arousal 300>><<gstress>><<garousal>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "泼酒软化封胶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-pose-choices">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300 or ($willpower or 0) gte 450>>
<span class="green">你假装手腕无力晃洒了半杯果酒，你用指甲轻轻一抠便掀松了半边窗框。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">冰凉的果酒大半溅在了你自己的裙摆上，湿冷黏腻的布料贴在腿侧反而令你狼狈不堪。</span>
<<stress 4>><<arousal 200>><<gstress>><<garousal>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Velvet Doll Hairpin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你背对单向雾化玻璃蹲在软垫阴影里，将拔下的细银簪探入脚踝银链的钥匙孔。展厅外悠扬的大提琴曲掩盖了细微的金属刮擦声。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[银簪藏回袖口 (0:02)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-hairpin-choices">
<<sneakicon>><<link "拨开踝链锁簧 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#velvet-hairpin-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 380>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
<span class="green">你顺着大提琴重音的节拍一点点顶起内侧黄铜弹子，只虚挂在脚踝上掩人耳目。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 50)>><<skulduggery 4>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">展柜内的兰花甜香让你指尖发滑，反而划伤了脚踝皮肤。</span>
<<pain 5>><<stress 5>><<arousal 400>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<garousal>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link "鞋跟撬开气栅 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-hairpin-choices">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 12000 or ($athletics or 0) gte 320>>
<span class="green">你借着丝绒裙摆掩护，两颗锈蚀的螺丝连着铅封被整根撬起。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<physique 2>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">黄铜格栅咬合得比预想中紧得多，外廊的巡逻执事也朝展柜投来审视的一瞥。</span>
<<pain 4>><<stress 5>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Velvet Doll Curtain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你走近镶嵌着落地铜镜的展柜内壁，铜镜背后的夹墙里传来了三声轻叩。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[抹去镜面水痕 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-curtain-choices">
<<mphearticon>><<link "对换气孔接钳 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-curtain-choices">>
<<if ($mpCompanion and ($mpCompanion.stage is "lover" or $mpCompanion.stage is "soulmate")) or (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and ($mpNpcs.monet.love or 0) gte 6)) or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
<span class="green">铜镜下方的暗缝被轻轻推开一寸，并低声与你对好了午夜拉闸断电的准确钟点。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 55)>><<stress -8>><<trauma -4>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("badend_velvet", 18, -8, -4, 0, 0, "与莫奈在天鹅绒展柜后廊接应你", { love: 1, trust: 2 })>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">夹墙外忽然响起执事催促送画的脚步声，你只能迅速抹掉镜面上的记号。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link "隔墙核对暗道 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-curtain-choices">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
<span class="green">你贴着镜框用指节轻敲出三短一长的回音，摸清了从画室暗廊通往康努达图斯街悬崖石阶的撤离路线。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">展厅外的弦乐声忽然拔高，盖过了夹墙里的低语，你没能听清暗道出口的门栓位置，心里一阵焦急。</span>
<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Velvet Doll EscapeWin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<unset $mpBadEndProgress>><<unset $mpBadEndDays>>
随着展厅吊灯突然熄灭，你一脚踢开脱扣的脚踝银链，推开松动的送餐侧窗翻出展台。在一片混乱的惊呼声中，你顺手卷走展台暗格里的紫檀筹码匣，跟着莫奈从悬崖秘道冲回了街面。
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冰凉的夜雨迎面浇下，瞬间驱散了展厅里甜腻的熏香。
<<else>>清冷的海风灌入胸腔，让你紧绷的神经彻底舒展开来。<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("badend_reward_velvet_doll")>>
	<<money 2200>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 2>><<willpower 8>><<stress -20>><<trauma -12>><<control 25>>
<<else>>
	你沿着熟悉的秘道迅速脱身，虽然暗格已经空了，但重获自由让你的心神安定下来。<<willpower 3>><<stress -12>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回康努达图斯 (0:05)|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转入峭壁街 (0:06)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP BadEnd Abbey Penance [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to ($mpBadEndProgress or 0)>><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1)>>
<<if ($mpBadEndId or "") isnot "abbey">><<set $mpBadEndId to "abbey">><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><</if>>
圣堂地下古修道院的静思石牢阴冷潮湿，脚下暗渠传来低沉水声。
<<if $stress gte 5000>>没药烟雾熏得太阳穴直跳，浮雕黑影在烛火下摇晃。<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>晚祷钟声震落细灰，看守修女的脚步声渐渐远去。<<else>>你把冰凉手腕贴在青苔上，辨认地面排水铁栅的铆钉走向。<</if>>
<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 100>>
	银链铆钉彻底松脱，暗河下传来了<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守夜人<</if>>猎犬的低吠。
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[脱链跃入暗渠 (0:14)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance EscapeWin]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 60>>铁栅铅封已融开大半。<<elseif ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 30>>看守戒心放松，铁栅撬出了细缝。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[随钟低诵祷词 (0:20)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance Chant]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[烛火烘烤铅封 (0:18)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance Wax]]>><<pass 18>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[对铁栅吹哨 (0:20)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance Hound]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link "借钟声记步点 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<replace "#abbey-penance-patience">>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 450 or ($purity or 0) gte 500>>
		<span class="green">你跪坐垫上借祈祷台边角磨薄了银链副环。</span><<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">苦杏仁没药味熏得你犯困，手腕被银链磨得生疼。</span><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1) + 1>><<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	<div id="abbey-penance-patience"></div>
<</if>>

:: MP BadEnd Abbey Penance Chant [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你垂下眼帘，将盛着净水与黑面包的木碗从栏杆下推了进来。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[放碗退回祈祷台 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="abbey-chant-choices">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "接碗顺走铜锥 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#abbey-chant-choices">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 550 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 340>>
<span class="green">你双手合十欠身接碗，无声无息地将执事遗落在石阶边的一枚铜制拔钉锥拢入膝下。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 45)>><<willpower 2>><<stress -3>><<gwillpower>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">你伸手时手腕银链撞在铁栏上发出一声脆响，冷冷盯着你把黑面包吃完才提灯离开。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "净水浸润链扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#abbey-chant-choices">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
<span class="green">你认出祈祷台底座用的是遇水易酥的旧石灰砂浆，用力一晃便让银链桩头松开了半寸。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">冰凉的净水顺着石台流进地缝，非但没能泡软铁桩，反而打湿了你膝下的祈祷垫，寒气直往骨头缝里钻。</span>
<<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Abbey Penance Wax [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你将手腕银链拉到极限，贴近地面排水铁格栅的铅封铆钉。暗红色的蜡油伴着滚烫的铅水一点点滴落。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[蜡烛放回铜台 (0:02)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="abbey-wax-choices">
<<sneakicon>><<link "火苗融开铆钉 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#abbey-wax-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 380>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
<span class="green">你稳稳托住烛台底座，铁格栅随之撬开一道足以容身的缺口。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 50)>><<skulduggery 3>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">暗渠吹来的一股冷风让烛火猛地倾斜，铅封只融化了浅浅一层。</span>
<<pain 6>><<stress 5>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link "鞋跟踹松铁栅 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#abbey-wax-choices">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11800 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
<span class="green">你趁着地下晚钟轰鸣的瞬间，露出了下方潺潺流动的暗渠水面。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<physique 2>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">生锈的铁格栅纹丝不动，反震的力道震得你脚跟发麻，长廊尽头还传来了看守修女查看动静的脚步声。</span>
<<pain 4>><<stress 5>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Abbey Penance Hound [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你俯身贴近地面排水铁格栅，对着幽暗的地下暗河吹出两长一短的低沉哨音。水声尽头很快亮起一豆摇晃的黄铜防风灯光。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回祈祷台前 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="abbey-hound-choices">
<<mphearticon>><<link "接过油布包 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#abbey-hound-choices">>
<<if ($mpCompanion and ($mpCompanion.love gte 10 or $mpCompanion.trust gte 10)) or (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and ($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) gte 6)) or ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
<span class="green"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守夜人<</if>>的猎犬踩着浅滩游到铁栅正下方，三两下便锯薄了银链母扣。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 55)>><<stress -8>><<trauma -5>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("badend_abbey", 20, -8, -5, 0, 0, "有人在修道院暗河渡口接应你", { love: 1, trust: 2 })>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">暗河水位突然上涨，只能示意它先退回渡口免得暴露。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link "确认木舟位置 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#abbey-hound-choices">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>>
<span class="green">你借着拱渠回音与暗河尽头的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守夜人<</if>>对准了暗号，确认平底柏木舟就停在下游第一个石弯处等候接应。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">冰冷的水声混杂着风啸在石渠里回荡，你没能听清渡口传来的回音，潮气反而冻得你鼻尖发酸。</span>
<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Abbey Penance EscapeWin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<unset $mpBadEndProgress>><<unset $mpBadEndDays>>
趁着晚祷钟声掩盖整座地下修道院的声响，你猛地发力扯开锯断的银链，掀开排水铁栅跃入地下暗河。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守夜人<</if>>早已撑着木舟在渡口等候，一把将湿透的你拉上船板，顺着暗流划回了神殿后园。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("badend_reward_abbey_penance")>>
	<<money 2500>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 2>><<willpower 8>><<stress -20>><<trauma -12>><<control 25>>
<<else>>
	你在<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守夜人<</if>>的接应下平安脱困，胸中的阴霾被林间晚风吹散。<<willpower 3>><<stress -10>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:06)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[随阿什退入森林 (0:08)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">随阿什退入森林 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to ($mpBadEndProgress or 0)>><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1)>>
<<if ($mpBadEndId or "") isnot "smuggler">><<set $mpBadEndId to "smuggler">><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><</if>>
双桅走私船在近海浓雾中剧烈颠簸，甲板上不断传来水手长的呼喝。
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or Weather.name is "heavyClouds">>风浪拍得船体呻吟，木箱在摇晃中撞出窄道。<<elseif $pain gte 30>>麻绳磨得手腕发红，渗入的咸水正让绳结变滑。<<else>>你顶住木箱借力，借舷窗雾光打量抽水阀与门锁。<</if>>
<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 100>>
	立柱麻绳已磨断，舷窗外亮起了维斯快艇的三盏绿灯。
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[跃上快艇 (0:15)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo EscapeWin]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 60>>手腕麻绳已松脱大半。<<elseif ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 30>>木楔晃动，守舱水手也开始松懈。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[鞋跟蹬抽水阀 (0:20)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo Bilge]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<brothelicon>><<link [[朗姆酒引水手 (0:18)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo Rum]]>><<pass 18>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[靠舷窗划磷火 (0:16)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo Flare]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link "借浪涌磨绳结 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<replace "#smuggler-cargo-patience">>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 450 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
		<span class="green">你顺着船身起伏终于磨断了最外层的主股麻线。</span><<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">底舱颠簸晃得你头晕，手腕擦破了皮，麻绳反而更紧。</span><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1) + 1>><<pain 4>><<stress 5>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	<div id="smuggler-cargo-patience"></div>
<</if>>

:: MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo Bilge [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你趁着一个大浪将船身抛起的瞬间，用鞋跟卡住底舱角落的黄铜抽水阀手柄。咸腥的舱底水在木板缝隙间晃荡。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[虚搭麻绳退回 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="smuggler-bilge-choices">
<<fisticon>><<link "倒蹬水泵冲楔 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#smuggler-bilge-choices">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 12200 or ($athletics or 0) gte 300>>
<span class="green">你双腿蓄力猛地一蹬，高压舱底水嗤嗤喷涌而出，将固定立柱底座的橡木楔冲松了大半，手腕上的麻绳随之滑落。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 45)>><<physique 3>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">黄铜阀门锈得死紧，你鞋底一滑重重撞在隔间木板上，冰冷的舱底水溅湿了半条裤腿，阀门却只转了半格。</span>
<<pain 4>><<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "咸水浸松绳结 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#smuggler-bilge-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
<span class="green">你借着渗出的润滑油与咸水浸湿绳圈，拇指微缩便从紧绷的双套结里滑出了右手。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<skulduggery 3>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">麻绳吸饱咸水后反而膨胀收紧，勒得你手腕阵阵发麻，一时半会儿没能抽开。</span>
<<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo Rum [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你用指尖勾出货箱稻草里的黑瓶陈年朗姆酒，轻轻敲击舱门木板。满身酒气的守舱水手骂骂咧咧地拉开插销探进头来。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回木柱旁 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="smuggler-rum-choices">
<<brothelicon>><<link "递酒近身夺匙 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#smuggler-rum-choices">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 380 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 380>>
<span class="green">你半垂眼睫将黑瓶朗姆酒递过去，顺手摘下了他腰间的底舱钥匙串。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("badend_smuggler_sailor_pouch")>>
	<<money 1500>>
<</if>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 55)>><<skulduggery 3>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">水手一把抢过酒瓶却没有靠近，随后打着酒嗝把舱门重重关上。</span>
<<stress 5>><<arousal 300>><<gstress>><<garousal>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link "用情报换松绑 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#smuggler-rum-choices">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 280 or ($willpower or 0) gte 460>>
<span class="green">你压低声音点破船长私吞三号箱红利的把柄，转身去甲板核实。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">水手根本不信你的说辞，往地上啐了一口，警告你少耍花样。</span>
<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo Flare [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你垫着木箱凑到铸铁圆舷窗前，用摸到的防水火柴盒连续划出三道亮红色的磷火。海雾深处隐约传来双冲程引擎的低鸣。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[关窗退回货箱 (0:02)|MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="smuggler-flare-choices">
<<mphearticon>><<link "接住软梯 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#smuggler-flare-choices">>
<<if ($mpCompanion and $mpCompanion.isPartnerOnline) or (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and ($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) gte 6)) or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
<span class="green">维斯驾驶着黑色快艇贴着走私船盲区靠帮，并向底舱抛入一把锋利的水手割绳刀。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 60)>><<stress -8>><<lstress>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("badend_smuggler", 16, -8, -4, 0, 0, "与维斯驾驶快艇靠帮接应你逃离走私船", { love: 1, trust: 2 })>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">一个横浪突然拍在船舷上，你只好先缩回阴影。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "撬开油布暗箱 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#smuggler-flare-choices">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11800>>
<span class="green">你借着外海风浪的掩护用铁撬扁别开箱扣，还摸到了一包封存暗货。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("badend_smuggler_flare_crate")>>
	<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">木箱外层钉着双排铁皮箍，你徒手去掰时指甲被铁刺刮痛，没能撬开箱盖。</span>
<<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Smuggler Cargo EscapeWin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<unset $mpBadEndProgress>><<unset $mpBadEndDays>>
趁着风浪拍击甲板的巨响，你推开底舱圆舷窗，顺着软梯一跃跳上维斯的接应快艇。快艇引擎全速轰鸣，在走私船水手反应过来之前便切入礁石水道，平安驶回了旧港栈桥。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("badend_reward_smuggler_cargo")>>
	<<money 2000>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 3>><<willpower 9>><<stress -22>><<trauma -12>><<control 25>>
<<else>>
	快艇冲破浓雾靠上旧港栈桥，你踩上坚实的陆地，长长舒了一口气。<<willpower 3>><<stress -12>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港 (0:05)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
