:: MP BadEnd Glasshouse Nectar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to ($mpBadEndProgress or 0)>><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1)>>
<<if ($mpBadEndId or "") isnot "glasshouse">><<set $mpBadEndId to "glasshouse">><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><</if>>
秘密温室地下育种厅水雾氤氲，甜腻花粉雾气令你浑身发软。
<<if $arousal gte 6000>>温热花蜜滴落锁骨，每一次喘息都带着甜香。<<elseif $worn.upper.integrity lte 40>>湿雾浸透破损衣衫，细藤顺着衣缝探入。<<else>>你用湿袖掩住口鼻，盯住右侧的碎玻璃与冷凝铜阀。<</if>>
