:: MP BadEnd Bailey Basement [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to ($mpBadEndProgress or 0)>><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1)>>
<<if ($mpBadEndId or "") isnot "bailey">><<set $mpBadEndId to "bailey">><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><</if>>
孤儿院地底训诫室亮着刺眼白炽灯，你的手腕被黑铁短链锁在暖气主管旁，门外传来打手踱步声。
<<if $pain gte 40>>肩背淤青隐痛，但暖气管温热让手指依然灵活。<<elseif $stress gte 5000>>白光刺得眼眶发酸，你紧盯着墙角运煤铁板。<<else>>你借阴影曲起手指，摸索法兰盘与运煤口位置。<</if>>
<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 100>>
	运煤滑道铁盖已撬开，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>巡夜人<</if>>在锅炉房备好了接应撬棍。
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[钻煤道滑出 (0:12)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement EscapeWin]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 60>>腕铐螺母与滑道合页均已松脱。<<elseif ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) gte 30>>你已藏好铁钉并摸清巡查间隙。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[装力竭签字 (0:18)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement Feign]]>><<pass 18>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[抠钉撬开煤盖 (0:20)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement Chute]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[铁铐敲暖气管 (0:16)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement Pipe]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link "借热胀拧螺母 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<replace "#bailey-basement-patience">>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 460 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11800>>
		<span class="green">你趁夜间加压供暖垫着衣角将六角螺母拧松三圈。</span><<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">滚烫主管烫红指腹，螺母被铁锈咬死未能拧动。</span><<set $mpBadEndDays to ($mpBadEndDays or 1) + 1>><<pain 4>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	<div id="bailey-basement-patience"></div>
<</if>>

:: MP BadEnd Bailey Basement Feign [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你故意垂下脑袋，掏出钥匙解开了你右手的副铐。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回暖气管旁 (0:02)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="bailey-feign-choices">
<<sneakicon>><<link "掉笔顺走副匙 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#bailey-feign-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 380>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
<span class="green">你假装手抖握不住钢笔将其掉在铁桌下，两指飞快地摘下了他皮带副环上的半截备用铜匙。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 45)>><<skulduggery 3>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">打手一眼识破了你的小动作，一脚踢开钢笔并重新锁紧了你的副铐，威胁你再耍花招就饿上两天。</span>
<<pain 5>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link "碰翻墨水瓶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#bailey-feign-choices">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 450>>
<span class="green">你装作眼花手滑将整瓶蓝黑墨水泼在了契约金额栏上，为你争取到一刻钟空档。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 35)>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">打手眼疾手快地按住了墨水瓶，反手将你的手腕按在冰冷的铁桌面上，逼你在角落先按了个指印。</span>
<<pain 4>><<stress 5>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Bailey Basement Chute [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你把从墙角抠出的扁平长铁钉插进运煤滑道铁盖的合页缝里，后方通往旧锅炉房的倾斜滑道隐约透出一丝煤灰气。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[煤灰掩住撬痕 (0:03)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="bailey-chute-choices">
<<sneakicon>><<link "压身撬开合页 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#bailey-chute-choices">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 380 or ($physique or 10000) gte 12200>>
<span class="green">你用湿布包住铁钉尾端用力下压，老旧的铸铁合页发出一声极轻的闷响，两颗锈钉应声崩断，滑道铁盖被你彻底掀开。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 50)>><<skulduggery 3>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">扁铁钉在坚硬的合页缝里弯折成两截，你的指节重重磕在水泥墙角上，合页只撬开了一条窄缝。</span>
<<pain 5>><<stress 5>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "摸索滑道暗盒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#bailey-chute-choices">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
<span class="green">你顺着滑道内壁的松动砖块摸进去，取出一只被前任院童藏在煤灰下的铁皮盒，里面有一把小巧的十字螺丝刀。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">滑道里积满了呛人的黑煤灰，你摸了半天只抓出一手煤渣，还差点呛得咳嗽出声。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Bailey Basement Pipe [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你举起手腕上的黑铁短链，在通往楼上与锅炉房的暖气主管上连续敲击了五下。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[轻放铁链待回声 (0:02)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="bailey-pipe-choices">
<<mphearticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link "接过撬棍 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#bailey-pipe-choices">>
<<if ($mpCompanion and ($mpCompanion.love gte 10 or $mpCompanion.isPartnerOnline)) or (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and ($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) gte 6)) or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
<span class="green">管壁很快传来三记沉稳有力的回击，将一根钢制撬棍与一卷护腕绷带塞进你手里。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 60)>><<stress -10>><<pain -4>><<lstress>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("badend_bailey", 16, -10, -5, 0, 0, "有人顺着锅炉房运煤道救你脱离地下训诫室", { love: 2, trust: 2 })>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">锅炉房正好在排汽放水，门外打手反而敲了敲铁门喝令你安静。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">从运煤口接过<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>巡夜人<</if>>的撬棍 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "撬开旧账铁柜 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#bailey-pipe-choices">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320 or ($physique or 10000) gte 12000>>
<span class="green">你借着暖气管道的掩护用撬棍别开墙角备用铁柜的挂锁，同时解开了主链挂钩。</span>
<<set $mpBadEndProgress to Math.min(100, ($mpBadEndProgress or 0) + 40)>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">铁柜挂锁纹丝不动，金属摩擦声惊动了走廊尽头的看守，你只得迅速缩回管边假装闭目养神。</span>
<<stress 5>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP BadEnd Bailey Basement EscapeWin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<unset $mpBadEndProgress>><<unset $mpBadEndDays>>
你挣开暖气主管上的黑铁短链，顺着撬开的运煤滑道滑入旧锅炉房。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>巡夜人<</if>>在后方用铁栓反锁了滑道重门，护送你从花园枯井侧门安然返回了孤儿院。
<<if ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) lt 8>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("badend_reward_bailey_basement")>>
	<<money 2100>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<willpower 8>><<stress -20>><<trauma -12>><<control 25>>
<<else>>
	你顺着熟悉的锅炉房秘道脱身，回到安全的走廊后长舒了一口气。<<willpower 3>><<stress -10>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回卧室休整 (0:05)|Bedroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

